            "start_line": 28,
            "end_line": 33,
            "line_count": 6,
            "preview": "// First value to merge: every boolean flag enabled (ignoreUnknown, allowGetters, // allowSetters, merge), with no ignored property names. Set<String> noIgnoredProperties = JsonIgnoreProperties.Value.empty().getIgnored();"
