            "end_line": 50,
            "line_count": 6,
            "preview": "// Merge: flags are OR-ed together, so every flag ends up true. JsonIgnoreProperties.Value merged = JsonIgnoreProperties.Value.mergeAll(valuesToMerge); assertNotNull(merged);"
